            </note>
            <note corresp="#d162-f4" n="4" xml:id="d162-f4-content">
                <p>This reference is apparently in error; no copy of a telegram 76 from Geneva to
                    Seoul has been found in Department of State files. Possibly, the allusion is to
                    the conversation with Pyun covered in telegram 78, May 14, from Geneva, <ref
                        target="#pg270">p. 270</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
